msgstr "根据文章和媒体上下文构建确定性媒体标题、替代项、说明文字、描述、来源和披露建议。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:226
msgid "Position Inline Image Blocks"
msgstr "定位内联图像块"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:227
msgid "Places generated inline image blocks after matching paragraph, heading, or anchor targets and falls back to append."
msgstr "在匹配段落、标题或锚点目标之后放置生成的内联图像块，然后回退到附加。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:262
msgid "Get Media Cleanup Opportunities"
msgstr "获得媒体清理机会"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:263
msgid "Scans a bounded media inventory and returns cleanup opportunities for metadata gaps, source gaps, and likely unused assets."
msgstr "扫描有限的媒体库存并返回元数据间隙、源间隙和可能未使用的资产的清理机会。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:292
msgid "List Media Backups"
msgstr "列出媒体备份"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:293
msgid "Lists recorded backup files for one attachment media operation history without mutating media."
msgstr "列出一份附件媒体操作历史记录的备份文件，无需更改媒体。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:322
msgid "Build Media Inventory Fix Plan"
msgstr "制定媒体库存修复计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:323
msgid "Maps bounded media inventory issues to reviewable metadata and cleanup actions that reuse existing governed write abilities without mutating media."
msgstr "将有限的媒体库存问题映射到可审查的元数据和清理操作，以重用现有的受控写入功能而不改变媒体。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:362
msgid "Build Media Reference Repair Plan"
msgstr "构建介质参考修复计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:363
msgid "Scans post content for hard-coded URLs to a previously replaced media file and builds governed patch-post-content actions without mutating posts."
msgstr "扫描文章内容以查找之前替换的媒体文件中的硬编码 URL，并构建受管理的补丁文章内容操作，而无需更改文章。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:398
msgid "Build Media Adoption Enhancement Plan"
msgstr "构建媒体采用增强计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:399
msgid "Builds a read-only batch plan that imports a reviewed remote image, generates an optimized derivative, and optionally patches one post from an old media URL to the optimized derivative."
msgstr "构建只读批处理计划：导入已审核的远程图片，生成优化衍生文件，并可选地将一篇文章中的旧媒体 URL 修补为优化衍生文件 URL。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:446
msgid "Build Image Candidate Adoption Plan"
msgstr "构建图片候选采用计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:447
msgid "Builds a read-only batch plan for importing one reviewed image candidate, applying reviewed media metadata, and optionally setting it as a post featured image."
msgstr "构建只读批处理计划：导入一个已审核的图片候选，应用已审核的媒体元数据，并可选地将其设为文章特色图片。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:495
msgid "Build Image Candidate Review Artifact"
msgstr "构建图片候选审核工件"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:496
msgid "Normalizes already retrieved image_candidate.v1 rows into a review-only artifact and lightweight recommendation projections without searching, generating, importing, or writing media."
msgstr "将已获取的 image_candidate.v1 行规范化为仅供审核的工件和轻量推荐投影，不搜索、不生成、不导入，也不写入媒体。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:530
msgid "Build Media ALT/Caption Review Set"
msgstr "构建媒体 ALT/说明文字审核集"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:531
msgid "Builds a deterministic review-only media ALT and caption candidate set from supplied media metadata and optional reviewed image-context evidence without inspecting pixels or writing media."
msgstr "根据提供的媒体元数据和可选的已审核图片上下文证据，确定性地构建仅用于审核的媒体 ALT 与说明文字候选集，不检查像素，也不写入媒体。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:596
msgid "Build Media ALT Apply Plan"
msgstr "构建媒体 ALT 应用计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:597
msgid "Builds one governed missing-ALT apply plan from an operator-reviewed image without approving, executing, or writing media."
msgstr "基于操作者已审核的图片构建一个受治理的缺失 ALT 应用计划，不进行批准、执行或媒体写入。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:631
msgid "Build Media Settings Reference Repair Plan"
msgstr "构建媒体设置参考修复计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:632
msgid "Scans selected WordPress options and theme mods for hard-coded URLs to a previously replaced media file and builds governed exact replacement actions without mutating settings."
msgstr "扫描选定的 WordPress 选项和主题模组以将 URL 硬编码到之前替换的媒体文件中，并构建受管控的精确替换操作，而无需更改设置。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:675
msgid "Get Media Inventory Health"
msgstr "获取媒体库存状况"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:676
msgid "Scans a bounded media inventory and summarizes missing alt text, captions, descriptions, source metadata, and format attention."
msgstr "扫描有限的媒体清单并总结丢失的替代文本、标题、描述、源元数据和格式注意。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:726
msgid "Inspect Media Asset"
msgstr "检查媒体资产"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:727
msgid "Inspects one attachment file and returns read-only format, size, dimension, and optimization recommendations."
msgstr "检查一个附件文件并返回只读格式、大小、维度和优化建议。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:780
msgid "Build Media Derivative Cloud Request"
msgstr "构建媒体衍生云请求"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:781
msgid "Builds a read-only request contract for a host or Cloud addon to generate an optimized media derivative without uploading, calling Cloud, or mutating WordPress."
msgstr "为主机或 Cloud Addon 构建只读请求合约，以生成优化的媒体衍生品，而无需上传、调用云或更改 WordPress。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:857
msgid "Build Media Optimization Plan"
msgstr "制定媒体优化计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:858
msgid "Builds a read-only one-attachment optimization plan that combines reviewed media metadata updates with a governed derivative adoption action for one Core approval."
msgstr "构建一项只读单附件优化计划，该计划将经过审核的媒体元数据更新与受管理的派生采用操作相结合，以获得一次 Core 批准。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:912
msgid "Build Media Adoption Preflight Summary"
msgstr "构建媒体采用预检摘要"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:913
msgid "Builds a read-only preflight summary for adopting one reviewed media derivative artifact, including current asset evidence, derivative comparison, bounded content-reference impact, and next-step guidance without mutating WordPress."
msgstr "为采用一个已审核的媒体衍生工件构建只读预检摘要，包括当前资产证据、衍生文件对比、有边界的内容引用影响和下一步指引，而不更改 WordPress。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:962
msgid "Build Media Rename Plan"
msgstr "构建媒体重命名计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:963
msgid "Builds a read-only one-attachment rename plan for a reviewed target media file name and exact post-content reference updates without mutating WordPress."
msgstr "为已审核的目标媒体文件名和准确的内容后参考更新构建只读单附件重命名计划，而无需更改 WordPress。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:1000
msgid "Build Media Derivative Batch Plan"
msgstr "构建媒体衍生批次计划"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/Media_Governance_Read_Definitions.php:1001
msgid "Builds a bounded read-only plan for batch Cloud media derivative previews from local media filters without calling Cloud, creating proposals, or mutating WordPress."
msgstr "为从本地媒体过滤器批量云媒体衍生品预览构建有界只读计划，无需调用云、创建提案或改变 WordPress。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:27
msgid "WordPress Diagnostics Summary"
msgstr "WordPress 诊断摘要"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:28
msgid "Returns a redacted local WordPress diagnostics summary without Npcink AI, MCP, filesystem path, database name, or secret details."
msgstr "返回经过编辑的本地 WordPress 诊断摘要，不包含 Npcink AI、MCP、文件系统路径、数据库名称或机密详细信息。"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:76
msgid "WordPress Operations Diagnostics Detail"
msgstr "WordPress 操作诊断详细信息"

#: includes/Packages/Read_Definitions/WordPress_Diagnostics_Definitions.php:77
msgid "Returns bounded local WordPress operations diagnostics with plugin, caller capability, PHP, cache, rewrite, HTTPS, server, database, cron, structured log, content type, role, widget, block-theme, search, integration, SEO, security, and performance details."
msgstr "返回有界本地 WordPress 操作诊断，包括插件、调用者功能、PHP、缓存、重写、HTTPS、服务器、数据库、cron、结构化日志、内容类型、角色、小部件、块主题、搜索、集成、SEO、安全性和性能详细信息。"

